BT 1 0 0 1 18 19.5 Tm .34 0 Td 15.5 TL /F3 11.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Cron service:) Tj /F2 11.5 Tf ( ) Tj /F5 10 Tf (systemctl is-active cron) Tj /F2 11.5 Tf ( should print "active". If the service is stopped,) Tj T* -0.34 0 Td (no job will run.) Tj T* ET
