BT 1 0 0 1 18 50.5 Tm .34 0 Td 15.5 TL /F3 11.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (System log:) Tj /F2 11.5 Tf ( cron writes a line every time it starts a job. The command ) Tj /F5 10 Tf (sudo journalctl -u) Tj T* -0.34 0 Td (cron | grep fetch_orders) Tj /F2 11.5 Tf ( shows the script path with the time cron launched it. This) Tj T* (proves that cron itself started the script. \(On some systems the same lines are in) Tj T* (/var/log/syslog.\)) Tj T* ET
